# Out of Office: The Musical

An out-of-office notice that nobody could ignore. Written, performed, scored, and animated as a
full production instead of a two-line auto-reply.

[![Out of Office: The Musical](https://img.youtube.com/vi/wE2SKlTsxnY/maxresdefault.jpg)](https://youtu.be/wE2SKlTsxnY)

*Click to watch.*

## Why it's here

This is an example of the hybrid workflow I keep describing elsewhere in this
repo: generative tools doing the parts they're good at, a human doing the parts that carry the
piece. The joke only lands because the timing, the phrasing, and the vocal performance are
deliberate. No model wrote the line about the cruise internet package.

